    Bug 1909247 - Apply footer button styling on account hub dialog. r=aleca

    **How to Test**
    - Open account hub dialog
    - Update email.mjs, go to the states global variable and update the fields on the first entry for previousStep and customActionFluentID
    - The previousStep field can be the same as the id of the first state
    - The customActionFluentID field can be and string from the states for that specific field
    - Test default, hover, focus, and active states using developer console

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D217506

